      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Bake coal or lignite in the §3Combination Oven§r for §6Coke§r and creosote. Petroleum coke comes from the Coker Unit and from baking crude tar. Coke is needed for steel, and it burns as long as two pieces of coal.\n\nPress coal powder, lignite powder or sawdust with a flat stamp into §6Briquettes§r. They burn longer than the powder, and coal and lignite briquettes bake into coke too.\n\nBurn times, in items smelted:\n- Sawdust briquette - 2. Lignite briquette - 8. Coal briquette - 10.\n- Coke - 16. Infernal coal - 24.\n- §6Presto Log§r (solid fuel, paper and redstone) - 40. Three logs and a dynamite ball make §6Boosted Presto Logs§r - 200.\n- The balefire versions burn ten times as long.",
